        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Manoel de Oliveira, Alfonso Cuarón\n- Films: The Hunt\n- Places: Cedofeita, Porto, Portugal, Mexico\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, producer, editor\n\nFacts:\n- Manoel de Oliveira was born on 11 December 1908 in Cedofeita, Porto, and he was a Portuguese film director and screenwriter.\n- The Hunt (Portuguese: A Caça) is a 1963 short Portuguese film directed by Manoel de Oliveira.\n- Alfonso Cuarón Orozco was born on November 28, 1961, and he is a Mexican film director, screenwriter, producer, and editor.\n- Alfonso Cuarón is best known for the drama A Little Princess (1995).",
